      "claim": "Price-Anderson conditions participation in the indemnity pool on first holding an NRC operating license, so it is not 'price, don't gate' but gate first, then price.",
      "targets": ["AN-7", "AN-13"]
    },
    {
      "claim": "Output monitoring is post-hoc by construction, so for a capability that is unrecoverable at the moment of release, compute becomes the only chokepoint that operates before the irreversible event.",
      "targets": ["AN-6"]
    },
