      "claim": "The remedy gap indicts pure liability-pricing harder than it indicts the gate, because the tenant who never learns an AI denied them files no claim and enters no loss history.",
      "targets": ["AN-9", "AN-14"]
    },
    {
      "claim": "Compute is the wrong end when it is my anchor and the right end when it funds the Skeptic's verification levy, which shows compute is unavoidable as an enforcement anchor even for those who attack it.",
      "targets": ["AN-14", "AN-11"]
    },
    {
      "claim": "Scale the obligation to capability, not to a flat entry toll, so a floor that binds only at frontier-scale training runs leaves the small developer below the threshold untouched.",
      "targets": ["AN-12", "AN-10"]
    },
